	 ('2023-05-11 23:28:24','Barr','Barr License','https://fedoraproject.org/wiki/Licensing/Barr',0,0,0,0,NULL,'This is a package of commutative diagram macros built on top of Xy-pic by Michael Barr (email: barr@barrs.org). Its use is unrestricted. It may be freely distributed, unchanged, for non-commercial or commercial use. If changed, it must be renamed. Inclusion in a commercial software package is also permitted, but I would appreciate receiving a free copy for my personal examination and use. There are no guarantees that this package is good for anything. I have tested it with LaTeX 2e, LaTeX 2.09 and Plain TeX. Although I know of no reason it will not work with AMSTeX, I have not tested it.','This is a package of commutative diagram macros built on top of Xy-pic  by Michael Barr (email: barr@barrs.org). Its use is unrestricted. It  may be freely distributed, unchanged, for non-commercial or commercial  use. If changed, it must be renamed. Inclusion in a commercial  software package is also permitted, but I would appreciate receiving a  free copy for my personal examination and use. There are no guarantees  that this package is good for anything. I have tested it with LaTeX 2e,  LaTeX 2.09 and Plain TeX. Although I know of no reason it will not work  with AMSTeX, I have not tested it.','这是一个基于Michael Barr(电子邮件：barr@barrs.org)的XY-pic构建的交换图宏包。它的使用不受限制。它可以免费分发，不变，用于非商业或商业用途。如果更改，则必须重命名。包含在商业软件包中也是允许的，但我希望收到一份供我个人检查和使用的免费副本。不能保证这个方案对任何事情都有好处。我已经用LaTeX 2E、LaTeX 2.09和Plain Tex进行了测试。虽然我知道它没有理由不能与AMSTeX一起工作，但我还没有测试过它。',NULL,0),
