	 ('2023-05-11 23:28:24','freertos-exception-2.0','FreeRTOS Exception 2.0','https://web.archive.org/web/20060809182744/http://www.freertos.org/a00114.html',0,0,0,0,NULL,NULL,'Any FreeRTOS source code, whether modified or in its original release form, or whether in whole or in part, can only be distributed by you under the terms of the GNU General Public License plus this exception. An independent module is a module which is not derived from or based on FreeRTOS.

EXCEPTION TEXT:

Clause 1

Linking FreeRTOS statically or dynamically with other modules is making a combined work based on FreeRTOS. Thus, the terms and conditions of the GNU General Public License cover the whole combination.

As a special exception, the copyright holder of FreeRTOS gives you permission to link FreeRTOS with independent modules that communicate with FreeRTOS solely through the FreeRTOS API interface, regardless of the license terms of these independent modules, and to copy and distribute the resulting combined work under terms of your choice, provided that

Every copy of the combined work is accompanied by a written statement that details to the recipient the version of FreeRTOS used and an offer by yourself to provide the FreeRTOS source code (including any modifications you may have made) should the recipient request it.

The combined work is not itself an RTOS, scheduler, kernel or related product.

The independent modules add significant and primary functionality to FreeRTOS and do not merely extend the existing functionality already present in FreeRTOS.

Clause 2

FreeRTOS may not be used for any competitive or comparative purpose, including the publication of any form of run time or compile time metric, without the express permission of Real Time Engineers Ltd. (this is the norm within the industry and is intended to ensure information accuracy).','任何FreeRTOS源代码，无论是修改后的源代码，还是原始发布形式的源代码，或者是全部或部分源代码，都只能由您根据GNU通用公共许可证以及此例外条款进行分发。独立模块是指不是派生自或基于自由实时操作系统的模块。

例外文本：

条例草案第1条

将自由实时操作系统与其他模块静态或动态地链接起来，就是在自由实时操作系统的基础上进行组合工作。因此，GNU通用公共许可证的条款和条件涵盖了整个组合。

作为特殊例外，自由实时操作系统的版权所有者允许您将自由实时操作系统链接到仅通过自由实时操作系统API接口与自由实时操作系统通信的独立模块，而不考虑这些独立模块的许可条款，并根据您选择的条款复制和分发最终的组合作品，前提是

每一份合并后的作品都附有一份书面声明，向接收者详细说明所使用的免费RTOS版本，以及如果接收者要求提供免费RTOS源代码(包括您可能进行的任何修改)的提议。

合并后的工作本身并不是RTOS、调度程序、内核或相关产品。

这些独立的模块为自由实时操作系统增加了重要的主要功能，而不仅仅是扩展了自由实时操作系统中已经存在的现有功能。

条例草案第2条

未经Real Time Engineering Ltd.明确许可，不得将FreeRTOS用于任何竞争性或可比性目的，包括发布任何形式的运行时或编译时指标(这是行业内的规范，旨在确保信息的准确性)。','This exception was used by the FreeRTOS project with GPL-2.0 until Amazon acquired the project and changed the license to MIT. Note, the exact text of the exception varied over the years and on different pages.',0),
	 ('2023-05-11 23:28:24','OCCT-exception-1.0','Open CASCADE Exception 1.0','http://www.opencascade.com/content/licensing',0,0,0,0,NULL,NULL,'Open CASCADE Exception (version 1.0) to GNU LGPL version 2.1.

